WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:08.220
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:14.730
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.560
It's my day!

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.140
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.550
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.920
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.330
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.100
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.240
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.750
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.890
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.950
I just want to walk

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.490
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.460
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:35.370
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.810
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.080
It's my day!

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:53.560
Rui Hanazawa, are you asleep?

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:54.960
Not yet.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:03.230
Too bad there weren't two sets
of bedding.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.140
It's okay. It's nice and warm.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.110
The house is drafty.

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:22.550
Can I... hold your hand?

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:25.420
Sure...

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:31.300
<i>Tonight... I'm gaining another scar.</i>

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:37.340
<i>Maybe he's the one...</i>

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:42.640
<i>...that can heal it, after all.</i>

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:54.620
"You're Not the One"

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.820
Rui Hanazawa... Thank you.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:03.460
For what?

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:07.100
<i>For being here.</i>

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.270
For saving me in the bath.

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:21.010
Oh... I was just finished with my bath
when Shigeru burst out...

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:25.020
<i>Hey! Help, somebody!</i>

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:29.120
She ran screeching past,
down the hallway.

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:35.530
But I must say, that girl
is really something. So intense.

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:36.860
Isn't she?

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:43.000
She's not like those rich girls
that're always around me.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:45.800
But...

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:50.240
She's cute. I like her.

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:55.180
She's bold, and she'll pull you
every which way...

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:58.680
like a precocious, strong-willed child...

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.690
and I find I can't dislike her.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.380
In some ways she's just like Tsukasa,
yet not like him.

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:08.660
He's also selfish, but 
without any of the charm.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.100
That's true.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:14.770
You finally laughed.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:16.730
Huh?

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:23.910
Oh, my... Was I really that bad off?

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:29.080
That's an understatement.
You looked like such a grouch.

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:32.870
I've been a grouch ever since
I started high school.

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.160
It's not just a recent thing.

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:38.890
Whoa, you're gearing up for 
another Makino Tsukushi tirade.

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:41.190
Even though you were just 
on the verge of tears.

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:45.030
Rui Hanazawa, you jerk! 
Quit it, will you?

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:48.340
Hmmph!

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:49.630
Ouch...

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:51.690
Keep it up. Keep it up.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:54.410
You can take it out on me if you like.

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:56.040
I'm not taking it out on you.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.110
Quit acting like you're
my big brother, will you?

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:19.600
<i>I always seem to find comfort in him,
when I'm in pain.</i>

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:26.000
<i>I don't feel sad and frustrated
anymore, but...</i>

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:44.590
<i>Even if my feelings for him
aren't romantic anymore...</i>

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:49.630
<i>I think I'll always love
Rui Hanazawa.</i>

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:53.830
Put on your clothes.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:08.150
Why?

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:13.150
How can you speak to me
so calmly?

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:23.900
I... I know I'm always
acting silly, but...

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:28.030
This isn't one of my games.

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:39.810
Don't you feel anything?

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:41.810
No, I don't.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:05.040
I see... I guess guys prefer to get
sexy glimpses...

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.570
instead of full-on nudity.

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:09.310
Shigeru...

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:12.940
Then how about this?

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:14.380
Shigeru.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:19.020
I could put on a garter belt,
if you like.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:21.660
Listen, I need to talk to you.

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:23.660
No! I don't want to listen!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:25.460
I...

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.560
I said I'd try.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.100
I'm sorry.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.950
W-what are you saying?

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:55.820
Why are you apologizing?!

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:57.720
This isn't funny!

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:02.530
You make me so mad!
Say what you mean!

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:07.470
Tsukasa!

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:10.230
You're not the one.

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:22.300
What was that sound? A burglar?

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:24.250
It sounded like it came from
Tsukasa's room.

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:27.120
B-but, it sounded
like a window breaking.

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:46.670
All I can think about is...

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:50.240
why those two were together today.

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:53.880
And what they're doing now.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.200
How does Makino feel about Rui?

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:58.780
Enough! Stop it!

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:04.260
Hey! We'd better go and see
what's happening.

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.190
Domyoji might be
forcing himself on her...

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.590
Tsukasa?

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:10.360
I think it's probably
the other way around.

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:14.300
Oh... There it goes again!

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.390
What are you saying?!

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:20.170
T-That's...
That's... possible, I guess.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:22.330
I'm going to have a look.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:23.210
Hey!

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:25.110
Do you still love Tsukushi?

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:32.520
Tsukushi smiled and
congratulated me, in the bath.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:35.220
She feels nothing for you!

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:44.530
Are you okay with that?

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:48.200
If that's the case,
why'd you go out with me?

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:49.930
Tsukasa!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.100
Shigeru!

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.230
I... I...

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:18.230
I'm sorry...

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.270
I didn't realize you were busy...

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:25.540
I-I-I... I called several times...

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:28.370
I'm sorry!

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:38.480
Do what you want.

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:42.690
Hit me until you're satisfied.

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.290
What are you doing?

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:19.760
It wasn't anything.

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:21.290
Did you see something?

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:25.790
N-No, no! I didn't see Shigeru on top!

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:26.630
On top?

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.100
What are you saying, Rui Hanazawa?

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.370
You saw them? You idiot.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.930
<i>Aargh! I can't stand it!</i>

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:38.310
<i>What am I doing here?!
I'm such a fool!</i>

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:59.700
I loved you...
How could you? It's awful...

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:01.970
Forgive me.

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:12.810
I'm sorry...

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:41.400
<i>I seem to remember someone
sleeping next to me...</i>

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:10.460
<i>I couldn't sleep... Not a wink.</i>

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:11.930
<i>Shigeru!</i>

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:24.510
<i>I... I... I'm sorry!</i>

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:27.350
<i>I didn't realize you were busy.</i>

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:31.650
<i>I-I-I... I called several times.</i>

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.450
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:40.790
<i>That scene is burned
into my memory.</i>

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:44.460
<i>Shigeru... in that position...</i>

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.310
<i>No!</i>

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:50.810
<i>Damn me and my awful timing!</i>

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:53.100
<i>Why'd I have to
go and see that?!</i>

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:56.870
<i>Why is this getting to me so bad?!</i>

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:00.410
<i>Yikes!</i>

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:05.820
<i>Yo.</i>

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:07.650
<i>Y-yo...</i>

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.300
<i>I've got to say something!</i>

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:20.310
<i>"Productive night, huh?"</i>

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:22.350
<i>"Congratulations
on losing your virginity."</i>

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:25.610
<i>Aargh! That's all I can think of!</i>

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:26.510
Aren't you...

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:27.640
Huh? What?

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:30.340
Aren't you cold, dressed like that?

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:31.310
Huh?

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:35.480
Oh, my robe? I-I'm fine.

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:36.950
I see...

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:53.130
<i>This isn't the way it is
with Rui Hanazawa...</i>

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:07.450
<i>Domyoji and I are getting more
uncomfortable with each other.</i>

00:16:12.520 --> 00:16:14.690
<i>It wasn't like this before.</i>

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:18.960
<i>It's hard to believe we used to fight
and yell at each other.</i>

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:20.630
<i>I miss that...</i>

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:23.900
<i>It's probably...</i>

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:31.100
<i>It's probably because
I'm so intensely aware of him.</i>

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:33.810
<i>Because, well...</i>

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.010
<i>I couldn't possibly...</i>

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:41.780
<i>sleep holding hands with Domyoji.</i>

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:48.350
I'm going to my room.

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:50.920
Makino...

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:51.690
Huh?

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.560
What is it?

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:58.500
I'm going on home.
Let Rui know, will you?

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.130
All right.

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:33.250
Shigeru, are you up?

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:34.600
Oh... Tsukushi?

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:39.740
I think I'd better get home.

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:42.940
Really? I think...

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.380
I think I'll stay awhile longer.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:47.480
I'll have my driver take you home.

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:49.480
Okay. Thanks.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.450
<i>Her eyes are bloodshot.
I guess she was crying.</i>

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:57.740
I saw Domyoji in the garden
a while ago.

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:58.990
He said he was going home.

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.590
Oh, uh, I see...

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:05.530
I guess he's a little embarrassed.

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:09.570
After all, he was so passionate
last night.

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:16.010
Uh, well... I'll be going.
Thanks for everything.

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:19.710
Have a safe trip home.
I'll be in touch.

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:51.610
<i>I loved you...
How could you? It's awful...</i>

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:53.980
<i>Forgive me.</i>

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:04.860
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.400
<i>Interesting...</i>

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.670
Rui Hanazawa...

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:31.540
It's awful to see someone
having sex, isn't it?

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:35.150
Yeah... I feel bad for you.

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:38.220
Yeah. I feel pretty sick.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.690
It keeps replaying in my head.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.920
I don't understand why men like
watching porn flicks.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:50.560
Some people can just laugh it off,
but I guess it depends on the person.

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:53.300
You feel bad because it was Tsukasa.

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:55.800
What are you saying?!

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:57.440
It would be the same,
whoever it was!

00:20:58.600 --> 00:20:59.870
What are you laughing about?!

00:21:11.780 --> 00:21:13.690
What are you doing?!
You little jerk!

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:26.100
<i>This feeling must be... but...</i>

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:31.640
<i>I can't admit it.
 I don't want to admit it.</i>

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:35.810
<i>If I do admit it...</i>

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:41.810
<i>I won't be able to stay the way I am...</i>

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:04.480
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:09.230
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:11.050 --> 00:22:18.700
Some day, the whole world

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:24.510
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:32.260
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:37.880
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:44.500
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:44.500 --> 00:22:50.900
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:50.900 --> 00:22:57.800
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:57.800 --> 00:23:06.680
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:07.960 --> 00:23:14.590
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:14.590 --> 00:23:20.650
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:21.190 --> 00:23:27.910
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:31.300
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:37.170
I already made it this far, after all.

00:23:46.260 --> 00:23:47.090
No way!

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:50.390
When my parents move away,
I'm suddenly left to live on my own.

00:23:50.660 --> 00:23:52.230
This just might work out.

00:23:52.300 --> 00:23:55.000
But I'm really nervous.

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:59.340
Thoughts of Domyoji
just won't leave my head.

00:23:59.800 --> 00:24:02.000
I don't want to remember!

00:24:02.510 --> 00:24:05.240
Hana Yori Dango: 
"Open Up Your Heart."

00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:07.610
But... it's too late.
